  "description_short": "Lakeside sports pub at Lake Pleasant Resort serving hearty pub grub with Groenvlei views.",
  "description_long": "Nestled at Lake Pleasant Resort on the edge of Groenvlei Lake, Legends Sports Pub brings proper pub atmosphere to Sedgefield's tranquil lakeside setting. The vibe is relaxed and welcoming, with screens showing live sports and a menu that delivers honest comfort food – think juicy burgers, loaded nachos, and proper fish and chips that pair perfectly with a cold beer.\n\nThe setting is unbeatable for a casual meal or afternoon drink, especially if you snag a spot on the deck overlooking the lake. It's popular with locals and holidaymakers alike, particularly families staying at the resort and groups settling in to watch the game. The kitchen keeps things simple and satisfying, focusing on the kind of food that goes down well with good company and lake views.\n\nWhether you're after a post-beach burger, somewhere to catch the rugby, or just a laid-back spot to enjoy Sedgefield's natural beauty with a plate of wings, Legends delivers exactly what a good sports pub should – no fuss, decent food, and a friendly atmosphere.",
